    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## M02 - GitHub events -> chat\n`POST /webhook/m02-github` with the GitHub headers. The body is verified with **HMAC-SHA256** (`X-Hub-Signature-256`, shared secret = `LAB_WEBHOOK_KEY`), deduplicated on `X-GitHub-Delivery` (P03, 7 days), routed by `X-GitHub-Event` (push / issues / other) and posted as one message.\n\nCore path posts to Mailpit (`dev@lab.local`); add a Telegram node (credential `Telegram - bot`) for a real chat. `test/send.py` signs and replays the seed payloads.",
